{"id":"n58169-13-5","stage":2,"title":"통하다 · 沟通","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58169-13-5-1","ko":"이게 얼마만이야? 잘 지냈어?","zh":"这都多久没见了啊？你最近过得怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이게","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이게","audio":"/audio/080ef3b94e3a9d861970.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마만이야?","meaning":"多少；表示过了一段时间。","explanation":"얼마：多少；만：表示过了一段时间；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"},{"term":"만","audio":"/audio/0fa2841136f2a818a173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"50295","senseId":"1","lemma":"만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마만이야","audio":"/audio/97f3b36a46ca00f3f8d9.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"지냈어?","meaning":"度过","explanation":"지내다：度过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"4","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지냈어","audio":"/audio/8833a72693bf7347d058.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]},{"id":"0fa2841136f2a818","term":"만","zh":"表示过了一段时间。","audio":"/audio/0fa2841136f2a818a173.mp3","entryId":"50295","definition":"表示过了一段时间。","pronunciation":["만"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"经过一定的时间。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/417c3d6f78e85838b7f7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58169-13-5-2","ko":"우리도 이제 소식 좀 통하고 살자.","zh":"我们也应该多联系，保持联系吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리도","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리도","audio":"/audio/e38d802f2fea2ee2a659.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"소식","meaning":"消息","explanation":"소식：消息。","readings":[{"term":"소식","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71143","senseId":"1","lemma":"소식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소식","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"통하고","meaning":"沟通，交流","explanation":"통하다：沟通，交流；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"통하다","audio":"/audio/feb666c5640cabcc5d63.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58169","senseId":"13","lemma":"통하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"통하고","audio":"/audio/d09fb7a7bbd8196231c7.mp3"}},{"text":"살자.","meaning":"生活，过活，过日子","explanation":"살다：生活，过活，过日子；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"2","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살자","audio":"/audio/335f645704044139e329.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"648fb8dfcf63ca8c","term":"소식","zh":"消息","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3","entryId":"71143","definition":"告知远方的人或不常见的人的情况或状况的话或文字。","pronunciation":["소식"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"feb666c5640cabcc","term":"통하다","zh":"沟通，交流","audio":"/audio/feb666c5640cabcc5d63.mp3","entryId":"58169","definition":"结成某种关系。","pronunciation":["통하다"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"生活，过活，过日子","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"人过生活。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bc9428604ffc415feabb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.807,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58169","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"13","sourceLevel":"중급","day":62,"sequenceScore":1.3591,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们也应该多联系，保持联系吧。","这都多久没见了啊？你最近过得怎么样？","这朵花有香味吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这都多久没见了啊？你最近过得怎么样？",